<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Lithosaver raises half-yr shr, div steady.</title>
<headline>Lithosaver raises half-yr shr, div steady.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Aug 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, pre-exceps (cts)	 17.0  vs  13.6</p>
<p>    Shr, after exceps (cts)	5.4  vs  13.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)			  3.5  vs   3.5</p>
<p>    Net income			 1.62 vs   2.99</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			    2.49 vs   4.79</p>
<p>    Tax				  0.87 vs   1.81</p>
<p>    Interest paid		    2.11 vs   0.24</p>
<p>    Turnover			 114.17 vs  68.18</p>
<p>Div payable Dec 13</p>
<p>on register Nov 22</p>
<p>Full name: Lithosaver Systems Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     3.45 vs 0.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it was satisfied with its performance and looked forward to strong consolidation in the second half.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
